<section class="section max-w-4xl">
  <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">At Animalife, we believe exceptional performance begins long before a horse enters the arena or steps onto the racetrack. It begins with supporting the biological systems that govern health, resilience, recovery, and longevity.</p>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">For too long, equine nutrition has focused on managing symptoms&mdash;reducing pain, or providing temporary support after problems have already developed. Our philosophy is different.</p>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">We formulate every product to support the body's natural ability to regulate, repair, and restore itself by targeting the physiological systems responsible for long-term health and performance.</p>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Whether supporting cartilage regeneration, reducing inflammation, optimizing kidney homeostasis, or enhancing oxygen transport and recovery, every ingredient is selected because it performs a defined biological function. Together, these ingredients work in harmony with the horse's natural physiology rather than attempting to override it.</p>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">This systems-based approach reflects our belief that lasting performance is not achieved by treating isolated symptoms, but by supporting the underlying biological processes that allow horses to perform, recover, and thrive throughout their lives.</p>

